ng-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97\" title=\"十四行诗\"><img alt=\"十四行诗\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E8%A1%8C%E8%AF%97\" title=\"十四行诗\">十四行诗</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span></div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302306</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">技能2</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-1技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-1技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-2技能.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-2技能 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-大招.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-大招 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-入场.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3023/302306/14-入场 - frame at 0m0s.jpg\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">“你……你可以的。”<br />优等生紧紧地捏住了裙摆，这是她第一次换下灰白格子的制服，换上如此隆重的裙装。<br />“按照彼特拉克的诗体形式编排，四、四、三、二……每行诗句都需要有十一个音节。嗯，这是合格的……”<br />她站在舞台的中心，聚光灯正打在她的身上。<br />观众席中空无一人。但借以灯光扫过的某个瞬间，她看见了一只紫色的箱子。它静静地卧在一角，安静得如同它的主人。<br />于是，优等生感到自己的心跳正在趋于平稳——她知道，箱子的主人一定会来。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302306\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/7c/Belonging-302310.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“演绎”系列手套<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Performing Arts\" Series Gloves</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />30<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一双用于正式场合的礼服手套，搭配亮色珍珠点缀。<br />作为公认的优等生，受访者熟练掌握多个领域的技能，但盛装打扮并不在其中。在人前呈现如此姿态，对她来说是一次极为难得的体验。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e0/Belonging-302311.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">诗的礼赞<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">In Praise of Poetry</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1.4<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一支从名称乃至价值都与受访者紧密相关的蘸水笔。上头点缀的香槟色羽毛，源于与拥有璀璨外表的飞行魔精的一次意外相遇。<br />她以此书写，记录，编织。它与记忆，与灵感有关。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302312.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f3/Belonging-302312.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">黑缎高跟鞋<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Black Satin Shoes</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />50<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>少见地选用缎面材质制作的黑色礼服舞鞋。<br />在苏芙比小姐的热情推荐下，受访者有幸饱览无数价格高昂的服饰，再三思忖后挑选了合适的一双。这并不关乎身份与价值，而是关乎成长与选择。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 诗的礼赞1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 诗的礼赞2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E8%AF%97%E7%9A%84%E7%A4%BC%E8%B5%9E2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\